# (build 165) A name across scripts: the Japanese cartridge chosen (Rolf's
# default its ユーシス), then the retranslation before the fight. The names
# cross as text, and a default of any language is the new one's: Eusis --
# kana made codes in the script charset would be blanks.
start battle 1
language ja
wait idle
language retranslation
wait ticks 1
press c                      # FIGHT
wait idle
expect script $1211
expect text "Eusis and the others won!"
